-- paperclip:migration-safety-ignore large-create-index-not-concurrently: Drizzle migrations run transactionally, so CONCURRENTLY is unavailable. Without this index the run-secret redaction lookup for an issue ORs an indexed `context_snapshot ->> 'issueId'` arm with an unindexed `context_snapshot -> 'paperclipIssue' ->> 'id'` arm, which forces a sequential scan that detoasts every run snapshot in the company on every issue-scoped redaction. The one-time build lock is the lesser cost.
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "heartbeat_runs_company_ctx_paperclip_issue_idx" ON "heartbeat_runs" USING btree ("company_id", (("context_snapshot" -> 'paperclipIssue') ->> 'id'));
